{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/119629-the-z-splat-in-demon-is-lores","id":119629,"title":"The Z-Splat in Demon is Lores?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-26T01:19:00-07:00","id":119629,"title":"The Z-Splat in Demon is Lores?","content":"Since I haven't read the PDF yet, I'm kind of surprised that Rose were talking about Lores for Demon. Are Lores the Z-splat for Demon, and if so, what kinds of Lore are there? Will there be a thread for Fan-Made Lores?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T01:21:10-07:00","id":119633,"title":"","content":"\u2026Lores were a basic powers thing in Demon: The Fallen, which will presumably be covered the Translation Guide, which Rose is presently in the process of writing.<br /> <br /> Your &quot;Z-splat,&quot; insofar as Descent has one, is your Cipher, which is categorically individualized. You get powers called Interlocks and eventually a signpost to Hell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T01:21:23-07:00","id":119635,"title":"","content":"Rose was talking about the Demon Translation Guide and its allowances to port Lores from Demon: the Fallen into the nWoD system. Demon: the Descent does not really have a &quot;Z-splat&quot; per se, at the least in the corebook. The Cipher takes over some of the role of the Z-splat as a source of power and meaning that's unique to each particular demon, but there is no list of Ciphers or Interlocks to &quot;join.&quot;<br /> <br /> Whether there's a thread for fan-made lores seems like a question to be answered by the fans!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-27T08:02:32-07:00","id":120341,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/119629-the-z-splat-in-demon-is-lores?p=119635#post119635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Cipher takes over some of the role of the Z-splat as a source of power and meaning that's unique to each particular demon, but there is no list of Ciphers or Interlocks to &quot;join.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div> Which may be covered in further books. I recall hearing that we probably will get a lot more detail in the future supplements. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-27T08:38:26-07:00","id":120356,"title":"","content":"I could also see Agencies filling the role of Z-Splat in games, depending on how your ST ran them. Although now that I write that, I actually think Cipher works better. Z-Splats as a rule tend to be smaller and more personal -- a refinement of what makes your character your character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1097-underwoodfive","name":"underwoodfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-27T09:19:01-07:00","id":120376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>underwoodfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/119629-the-z-splat-in-demon-is-lores?p=120356#post120356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I could also see Agencies filling the role of Z-Splat in games, depending on how your ST ran them. Although now that I write that, I actually think Cipher works better. Z-Splats as a rule tend to be smaller and more personal -- a refinement of what makes your character your character.</div> </div> </div> </div> Agencies tend to be more of a &quot;tier 2&quot; version of the Agendas. Look at the four kinds of agencies listed - compromised, free, temporal, insurgent. Matches up to Integrator (deal with angels), Interrogator (dedicated knowledge seekers), Tempter (most dedicated to building and trading temporal things), and Sabatour (dedicated to the fight), respectively. And its not like you can't mix and match agendas already.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-27T18:21:59-07:00","id":120649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JackalopeVegas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/119629-the-z-splat-in-demon-is-lores#post119629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since I haven't read the PDF yet, I'm kind of surprised that Rose were talking about Lores for Demon. Are Lores the Z-splat for Demon, and if so, what kinds of Lore are there? Will there be a thread for Fan-Made Lores?</div> </div> </div> </div>As said, Lores are the powers from <i>Demon: The Fallen</i>. The Translation Guide is going to write them up as a separate type of power, because taking them out of their existing ladders (five Evocations in each Lore) results in some weird and lopsided divisions.<br /> <br /> <i>Demon</i> doesn't really have a third splat type. On a setting level, Ciphers are similar to Athanors and also to Legacies, except that they start with introspection rather than initiation. Mechanically, though, there are only two splat types.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}